{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a desktop game. The little people in the farm will take care of the farm by themselves while you are working or studying. You can also manually operate to speed up this process. The farm will dynamically switch between day and night based on your time. During the night, the growth rate of plants will change (various plants will have different changing trends). During this period, you can also make more friends, and they can help you manage the farm more conveniently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/eb42e697e5e962602a1c7a019bd82e08.avif?t=1771171378\" width=616 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planting - Watering - Harvesting - Picking. The farmer will do it all by himself. Of course, you can also operate manually (except for picking).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/7ae1d4f436f10093780049fa2c3f0974.poster.avif?t=1771171378\" width=612 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/7ae1d4f436f10093780049fa2c3f0974.webm?t=1771171378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/7ae1d4f436f10093780049fa2c3f0974.mp4?t=1771171378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/5fa3d20f71ec110dc2cede2ba2804af6.poster.avif?t=1771171378\" width=612 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/5fa3d20f71ec110dc2cede2ba2804af6.webm?t=1771171378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/5fa3d20f71ec110dc2cede2ba2804af6.mp4?t=1771171378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/d249a44202765777632b913aaa7b5dea.poster.avif?t=1771171378\" width=612 height=88 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/d249a44202765777632b913aaa7b5dea.webm?t=1771171378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/d249a44202765777632b913aaa7b5dea.mp4?t=1771171378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/05929ece2804e3ffe59124413b4643b2.avif?t=1771171378\" width=616 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game progresses, a lost hunter will enter your farm. He will periodically go out to search for treasures, bringing back not only new seeds but also other companions. Each of them has their own unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/0ce1e46d1a9cd2e9112f303390846ecf.gif?t=1771171378\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/0ce1e46d1a9cd2e9112f303390846ecf.poster.avif?t=1771171378\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/31b8e756d2c627ccc4f756399bec7ab8.avif?t=1771171378\" width=616 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can put the harvested crops into the windmill, and soon you will get the seeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: Manual operation is not allowed.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/cf0249958dcdbcc76f344058c60ba334.gif?t=1771171378\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/cf0249958dcdbcc76f344058c60ba334.poster.avif?t=1771171378\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/ea80f505d744819cc56a476f41c92436.avif?t=1771171378\" width=616 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is also an mimic on the farm! Don't be scared! It will only eat the crops. And as you know, the items eaten by the mimic will turn into gold coins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/33af0869ee9b11e41daa54d4cc0b092c.poster.avif?t=1771171378\" width=606 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/33af0869ee9b11e41daa54d4cc0b092c.webm?t=1771171378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/33af0869ee9b11e41daa54d4cc0b092c.mp4?t=1771171378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/7d7073b419623075173a08b0236fe332.avif?t=1771171378\" width=616 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sun sets and night arrives. During the night, the growth rate of crops will vary. So what do you need at this time? Exactly! A beam of light!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/4b9c9fdfc0117797ce235136bf32fbbf.poster.avif?t=1771171378\" width=612 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/4b9c9fdfc0117797ce235136bf32fbbf.webm?t=1771171378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/4b9c9fdfc0117797ce235136bf32fbbf.mp4?t=1771171378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/37d6c266c1d12a750aa2f970e6ec7726.avif?t=1771171378\" width=616 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look! A red dot is flying through the night sky. What is it? Click to see!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/72f0565c2d36d94866ec7d1a3866758f.poster.avif?t=1771171378\" width=612 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/72f0565c2d36d94866ec7d1a3866758f.webm?t=1771171378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/72f0565c2d36d94866ec7d1a3866758f.mp4?t=1771171378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/8fe696610502c2f453b892da9bda5b02.avif?t=1771171378\" width=616 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How could farm life be complete without the company of animals? Besides the familiar chickens and cows, we have also prepared some unexpected animal companions. They not only produce agricultural products but some of them also have other special abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/72eb3c0c47347d609da2711a7f31aedc.poster.avif?t=1771171378\" width=606 height=670 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/72eb3c0c47347d609da2711a7f31aedc.webm?t=1771171378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/72eb3c0c47347d609da2711a7f31aedc.mp4?t=1771171378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/57d4b9a642b16816405ec0196f00197a.avif?t=1771171378\" width=616 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although farm life is fulfilling, sometimes it's okay to slow down. Why not try fishing quietly for a whole day at such times? Besides, we have prepared a special fishing game that can speed up your fishing progress while you are working or having fun as usual!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/94c9020a3eeaa9c5222bd15e1bab1d18.poster.avif?t=1771171378\" width=606 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/94c9020a3eeaa9c5222bd15e1bab1d18.webm?t=1771171378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/94c9020a3eeaa9c5222bd15e1bab1d18.mp4?t=1771171378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/753330db6ddbaae57bc161e002f8a536.avif?t=1771171378\" width=616 height=123 /></span>As a fisherman, don't you want to show off the big catch you've got to your friends? We've prepared an aquarium for you to put the fish you've caught in! And each kind of fish has its own special behavior!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here we show you one of them: Sardines. They are social creatures and will try to huddle together! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/9dac59cf9d3cd002f52d78558af1142c.avif?t=1771171378\" width=612 height=680 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/f813769451f0c0e7d079b7250b7fa414.poster.avif?t=1771171378\" width=606 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/f813769451f0c0e7d079b7250b7fa414.webm?t=1771171378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/f813769451f0c0e7d079b7250b7fa414.mp4?t=1771171378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/5f68f8bc554c6400e040cf0383533346.avif?t=1771171378\" width=616 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is the meaning of work? It is NOT WORKING! Here, once you have saved enough money, the protagonist will put down their work and go on a trip. During the trip, they will occasionally receive some gifts. You can use these gifts to decorate your farm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"One Small Step","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3857700/3e4008bd126dbc2896db16c46beb4c697fe234a4.jpg"},{"name":"One Giant Leap","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3857700/7fb2225695613fcfd9700d4b9982081560c85822.jpg"},{"name":"One Small Goal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3857700/72c168aa4239114f5fa16543c0f235fe8feb1f38.jpg"},{"name":"Take a Relaxing Break","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3857700/943c382d1c88d4eeeb99c3ba4ac59862560997c5.jpg"},{"name":"Full Collection \u00b7 Crops","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3857700/94e8db6f54b6fbe4a22c5c0e760c89fac869f229.jpg"},{"name":"Full Collection \u00b7 Fruit Trees","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3857700/766e0541736501883e44b5ce379726e890703aac.jpg"},{"name":"Full Collection \u00b7 Animals","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3857700/4d1e62301889054bdd9d6abb771ed5e8d42460f1.jpg"},{"name":"Full Collection \u00b7 Fish","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3857700/b679c157a4083578315d9ce42702f6b6d3252b39.jpg"},{"name":"Full Collection \u00b7 Decorations","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3857700/4d8894e0437887dd08574616079c649d67bf1808.jpg"},{"name":"More is Better","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3857700/81bbafaf1be2bd7c767a1cebeb5191653b5ec3e2.jpg"}],"total":30},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3857700?t=1771171378","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/579d252b6d0fec0a8badf602c79f9c97f761ec5c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771171378","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/2912343ff6fd4073b3b57af43c5e7dd16f4f6b7d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771171378","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/2912343ff6fd4073b3b57af43c5e7dd16f4f6b7d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771171378","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a desktop game. The little people in the farm will take care of the farm by themselves while you are working or studying. You can also manually operate to speed up this process. The farm will dynamically switch between day and night based on your time. During the night, the growth rate of plants will change (various plants will have different changing trends). During this period, you can also make more friends, and they can help you manage the farm more conveniently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/eb42e697e5e962602a1c7a019bd82e08.avif?t=1771171378\" width=616 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planting - Watering - Harvesting - Picking. The farmer will do it all by himself. Of course, you can also operate manually (except for picking).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/7ae1d4f436f10093780049fa2c3f0974.poster.avif?t=1771171378\" width=612 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/7ae1d4f436f10093780049fa2c3f0974.webm?t=1771171378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/7ae1d4f436f10093780049fa2c3f0974.mp4?t=1771171378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/5fa3d20f71ec110dc2cede2ba2804af6.poster.avif?t=1771171378\" width=612 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/5fa3d20f71ec110dc2cede2ba2804af6.webm?t=1771171378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/5fa3d20f71ec110dc2cede2ba2804af6.mp4?t=1771171378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/d249a44202765777632b913aaa7b5dea.poster.avif?t=1771171378\" width=612 height=88 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/d249a44202765777632b913aaa7b5dea.webm?t=1771171378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/d249a44202765777632b913aaa7b5dea.mp4?t=1771171378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/05929ece2804e3ffe59124413b4643b2.avif?t=1771171378\" width=616 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game progresses, a lost hunter will enter your farm. He will periodically go out to search for treasures, bringing back not only new seeds but also other companions. Each of them has their own unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/0ce1e46d1a9cd2e9112f303390846ecf.gif?t=1771171378\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/0ce1e46d1a9cd2e9112f303390846ecf.poster.avif?t=1771171378\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/31b8e756d2c627ccc4f756399bec7ab8.avif?t=1771171378\" width=616 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can put the harvested crops into the windmill, and soon you will get the seeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: Manual operation is not allowed.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/cf0249958dcdbcc76f344058c60ba334.gif?t=1771171378\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/cf0249958dcdbcc76f344058c60ba334.poster.avif?t=1771171378\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/ea80f505d744819cc56a476f41c92436.avif?t=1771171378\" width=616 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is also an mimic on the farm! Don't be scared! It will only eat the crops. And as you know, the items eaten by the mimic will turn into gold coins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/33af0869ee9b11e41daa54d4cc0b092c.poster.avif?t=1771171378\" width=606 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/33af0869ee9b11e41daa54d4cc0b092c.webm?t=1771171378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/33af0869ee9b11e41daa54d4cc0b092c.mp4?t=1771171378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/7d7073b419623075173a08b0236fe332.avif?t=1771171378\" width=616 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sun sets and night arrives. During the night, the growth rate of crops will vary. So what do you need at this time? Exactly! A beam of light!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/4b9c9fdfc0117797ce235136bf32fbbf.poster.avif?t=1771171378\" width=612 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/4b9c9fdfc0117797ce235136bf32fbbf.webm?t=1771171378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/4b9c9fdfc0117797ce235136bf32fbbf.mp4?t=1771171378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/37d6c266c1d12a750aa2f970e6ec7726.avif?t=1771171378\" width=616 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look! A red dot is flying through the night sky. What is it? Click to see!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/72f0565c2d36d94866ec7d1a3866758f.poster.avif?t=1771171378\" width=612 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/72f0565c2d36d94866ec7d1a3866758f.webm?t=1771171378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/72f0565c2d36d94866ec7d1a3866758f.mp4?t=1771171378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/8fe696610502c2f453b892da9bda5b02.avif?t=1771171378\" width=616 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How could farm life be complete without the company of animals? Besides the familiar chickens and cows, we have also prepared some unexpected animal companions. They not only produce agricultural products but some of them also have other special abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/72eb3c0c47347d609da2711a7f31aedc.poster.avif?t=1771171378\" width=606 height=670 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/72eb3c0c47347d609da2711a7f31aedc.webm?t=1771171378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/72eb3c0c47347d609da2711a7f31aedc.mp4?t=1771171378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/57d4b9a642b16816405ec0196f00197a.avif?t=1771171378\" width=616 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although farm life is fulfilling, sometimes it's okay to slow down. Why not try fishing quietly for a whole day at such times? Besides, we have prepared a special fishing game that can speed up your fishing progress while you are working or having fun as usual!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/94c9020a3eeaa9c5222bd15e1bab1d18.poster.avif?t=1771171378\" width=606 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/94c9020a3eeaa9c5222bd15e1bab1d18.webm?t=1771171378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/94c9020a3eeaa9c5222bd15e1bab1d18.mp4?t=1771171378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/753330db6ddbaae57bc161e002f8a536.avif?t=1771171378\" width=616 height=123 /></span>As a fisherman, don't you want to show off the big catch you've got to your friends? We've prepared an aquarium for you to put the fish you've caught in! And each kind of fish has its own special behavior!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here we show you one of them: Sardines. They are social creatures and will try to huddle together! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/9dac59cf9d3cd002f52d78558af1142c.avif?t=1771171378\" width=612 height=680 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/f813769451f0c0e7d079b7250b7fa414.poster.avif?t=1771171378\" width=606 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/f813769451f0c0e7d079b7250b7fa414.webm?t=1771171378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/f813769451f0c0e7d079b7250b7fa414.mp4?t=1771171378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/extras/5f68f8bc554c6400e040cf0383533346.avif?t=1771171378\" width=616 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is the meaning of work? It is NOT WORKING! Here, once you have saved enough money, the protagonist will put down their work and go on a trip. During the trip, they will occasionally receive some gifts. You can use these gifts to decorate your farm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Peaceful Game"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857700/c7f4fb4be2009ce1d71cfa60b0b50b2aff2bf57e/header.jpg?t=1771171378","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3857700/1383191024/ca118e151c7aaf213985591f640b1852f87ddf64/1770115157/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770116414","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3857700/1383191024/ca118e151c7aaf213985591f640b1852f87ddf64/1770115157/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770116414","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3857700/1383191024/ca118e151c7aaf213985591f640b1852f87ddf64/1770115157/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770116414","id":257178876,"name":"Launch Trailer EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257178876/b7a51f8d17a6f5